### HEALTH CHECKS
GET http://localhost:3000/health/live

###
GET http://localhost:3000/health/ready

###
# @name createWallet
POST http://localhost:3000/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": "player-123",
  "initialBalance": {
    "amount": "100.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Extrair walletId
@walletId = {{createWallet.response.body.id}}

### Criar uma BET Normal Válida
# @name submitBet
POST http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idemp-bet-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-abc",
  "externalTransactionId": "ext-tx-100",
  "playerId": "player-123",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "game-1",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {
    "amount": "10.50",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Testar a Idempotência (Deve devolver o replay com o mesmo resultado e flag)
POST http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idemp-bet-001

{
  "providerId": "provider-abc",
  "externalTransactionId": "ext-tx-100",
  "playerId": "player-123",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "game-1",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {
    "amount": "10.50",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Testar erro 422 - Saldo Insuficiente (BET maior que o saldo)
POST http://localhost:3000/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idemp-bet-002

{
  "providerId": "provider-abc",
  "externalTransactionId": "ext-tx-101",
  "playerId": "player-123",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "roundId": "round-1",
  "gameId": "game-1",
  "kind": "BET",
  "money": {
    "amount": "999.00",
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Reconciliação (Comparar ledger com saldo gravado)
POST http://localhost:3000/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation
Content-Type: application/json

{}
